Director constraints:

- Director is an operator touchscreen client that requests actions and displays returned state.
- Director is not authoritative show runtime and should not execute timeline logic.
- Commands flow Director -> Comms (ESP-NOW) -> P4 (UART path through Comms).
- Preserve degraded behavior: running shows must continue if Director disconnects.
- Preserve emergency interactions as request/display flow; P4 remains emergency authority.
- Distinguish local Director storage/UI metadata from authoritative P4 show state.
- Director build/board assumptions must remain aligned with current board config and LVGL stack.
